    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Wald-Guard</i>, you take on the role of a tiny bumblebee on a special journey in the form of a 2D platformer with the twist of the Floor being \u201cLava\u201d<br> With precise controls and quick reactions, you'll navigate challenging platforming sections, always in search of floating hearts. Every jump counts \u2013 one mistake, and you fall.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique 2D platformer with one simple rule: the ground is forbidden</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect hidden hearts and find your own path through each level</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wordless, atmospheric experience \u2013 completely without combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional accessibility features for a flexible, inclusive gameplay experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A moody, immersive soundtrack that carries you through the world</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master \u2013 <i>Wald-Guard</i> is a quiet challenge for anyone who wants to fly without ever touching the ground.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Wald-Guard</i>, you take on the role of a tiny bumblebee on a special journey in the form of a 2D platformer with the twist of the Floor being \u201cLava\u201d<br> With precise controls and quick reactions, you'll navigate challenging platforming sections, always in search of floating hearts. Every jump counts \u2013 one mistake, and you fall.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique 2D platformer with one simple rule: the ground is forbidden</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect hidden hearts and find your own path through each level</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wordless, atmospheric experience \u2013 completely without combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional accessibility features for a flexible, inclusive gameplay experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A moody, immersive soundtrack that carries you through the world</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master \u2013 <i>Wald-Guard</i> is a quiet challenge for anyone who wants to fly without ever touching the ground.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "In Wald-Guard, you explore a strange land as a bumblebee \u2014 but the ground is \u201cLava\u201d! Fly through precise 2D platforming levels, uncover hidden places, and overcome challenging obstacles.",
